CM_ SG_ 257 EngineStsForDCT "Engine Status For DCT
000：Init应该是指初始化状态，实际上这个值EMS发不出来的，CAN上都已经开始发送信号了，肯定都已经初始化完了。
001：发动机停机状态
010：指起动机正在拖动
011：发动机启动完成
100：因为故障导致跛行                                             
PHEV:If this Value is 2、3、4 indicated that the engine is started successfully. Used to enable EPS on behalf of HCU (HCU_EpsOnReq) ";
CM_ SG_ 257 MinTorqueAvailable "Minimum engine torque currently available at the flywheel (negative torque resulting from friction torque, air condition, other losses) by air path torque intervention.
  ";
CM_ SG_ 257 MaxTorqueAvailable "Maximum engine torque currently available (considering current engine speed) at the flywheel (consider friction torque, air condition, other losses) by torque intervention.This is the maximum torque that can be requested from and realized by the ECU at the current working point. Necessary for powered and motored downshifts. 
通过进气量控制的应用在飞轮端的当前最大发动机扭矩
  ";
